       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day, and the usual maximum for a single dose is 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** At this level the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events goes up sharply. Normal kidney and liver function and no allergies don't change that.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **600 mg by mouth, four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg by mouth, every 6 hours**, or another regimen\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional, and I can add a note with your rationale. I'd still recommend checking it with pharmacy first."
      }
